1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,570
You two look like a couple.

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,980
Is there something going on?

3
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:07,810
Oh! I'm sorry.

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,430
The path is pretty wide.

5
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:10,600
Did you do that on purpose?

6
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:12,940
Why did you follow me here?

7
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:15,360
Did I? I was jogging after practice.

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,240
You should apply to be an intern
for the soccer club.

9
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,200
The team really needs extra hands.

10
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:22,240
The two of us

11
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:23,360
are dating.

12
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:24,760
Hey.

13
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,600
Why do I have to see you everywhere?

14
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,680
I've been feeling a bit uneasy lately, Jinna.
[Go to hell]

15
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:34,000
Anyway, be careful for now, Anda.

16
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:35,960
This clearly was sent with bad intentions.

17
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:36,960
Podduang.

18
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,670
Wake up. You're home.

19
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:39,820
Yes, baby.

20
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:43,250
He's really out cold, huh?

21
00:01:36,039 --> 00:01:37,870
Your stir-fried veggies are here, baby.

22
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:30,360
Not even gonna wait?

23
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:30,970
What?!

24
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,920
Are you gonna follow me everywhere or what?!

25
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,400
Uh...

26
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:35,520
I'm sorry, dear.

27
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,360
I'm not...

28
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,440
- Uh... I'm leaving the elevator.
- Oh... I'm so sorry.

29
00:02:39,670 --> 00:02:40,660
- Right.
- I'm sorry, ma'am.

30
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,040
Right, right. I'm sorry.

31
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:54,680
Hey, Podduang.

32
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:56,800
I saw a young man drop you off last night.

33
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:57,990
So dope.

34
00:02:58,010 --> 00:02:59,420
Awesome stuff.

35
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,480
Are you the one who called
a ride to the university?

36
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,360
Uh... Yes.

37
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:28,490
Hop on, kiddo.

38
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,710
[The characters, organizations,
and events depicted in this series

39
00:03:40,730 --> 00:03:42,510
are entirely fictional
and intended solely for entertainment.

40
00:03:42,530 --> 00:03:44,320
The series does not endorse
any behavior depicted.

41
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:46,120
Viewer discretion is advised]

42
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:01,100
♫I once sought an answer♫

43
00:04:01,130 --> 00:04:04,960
♫To what we were together♫

44
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,830
♫Love, as I used to see it,♫

45
00:04:07,850 --> 00:04:11,560
♫Couldn't flourish without clarity♫

46
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:14,410
♫It took a long time♫

47
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:17,959
♫To realize what is important♫

48
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:20,730
♫There are no rules♫

49
00:04:20,750 --> 00:04:24,360
♫To love that we wish to bloom♫

50
00:04:25,550 --> 00:04:27,190
♫Simply recognizing♫

51
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:29,500
♫What your heart is desiring♫

52
00:04:29,530 --> 00:04:31,140
♫Is enough♫

53
00:04:31,370 --> 00:04:33,900
♫Just having you by my side♫

54
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:37,120
♫It's only you who I'm willing to see it through♫

55
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:41,580
♫Nothing else matters to me, it's true♫

56
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:44,650
♫Just hold my hand like this♫

57
00:04:44,670 --> 00:04:47,250
♫Just having you by my side♫

58
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:50,510
♫It's only you who I'm willing to see it through♫

59
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:54,830
♫No matter how tough the world may be,♫

60
00:04:54,850 --> 00:04:57,720
♫Just hold my hand like this♫

61
00:04:58,250 --> 00:05:01,000
♫And stay here right next to me♫

62
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,960
[Oops! Mysterious Sounds]

63
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,100
You did so well, you know?

64
00:05:14,950 --> 00:05:15,550
But...

65
00:05:15,670 --> 00:05:17,320
Don't watch the next scene, Kum.

66
00:05:18,730 --> 00:05:19,530
Why not?

67
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,040
It makes me flustered.

68
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,040
Let's watch it, then,

69
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:26,850
hm?

70
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:37,480
No, don't.

71
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,440
Totally killed it.

72
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,530
I told you not to watch it.

73
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,060
You're so different from
your character in the series.

74
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:54,060
What?

75
00:05:56,850 --> 00:05:57,770
Are you jealous?

76
00:05:58,060 --> 00:05:59,060
Nothing.

77
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:02,290
I know

78
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:03,930
how to make it up to you.

79
00:06:18,470 --> 00:06:19,120
See?

80
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,640
You're teasing this old dog's heart again.

81
00:06:22,490 --> 00:06:23,320
Huh?

82
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,200
What do you mean?

83
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,760
A short ad break first.

84
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,060
Huh?

85
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,450
Give me a second.

86
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:39,850
Ta-da...

87
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:41,060
For you.

88
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,610
What is it?

89
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,600
Open it.

90
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,640
[Anda]

91
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,060
Whoa...

92
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:57,040
Do you like it?

93
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,110
This is lovely.

94
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:04,060
Notice the number right here.

95
00:07:05,250 --> 00:07:06,670
Wow...

96
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:09,680
This is really sweet.

97
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,920
You're my first Andaman.

98
00:07:19,710 --> 00:07:20,810
Mm...

99
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:22,360
With this,

100
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:26,670
how should I reward my good boy?

101
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,650
What's the reward?

102
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,120
Just keep watching the series.

103
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,830
We're about to reach the climax.

104
00:07:36,850 --> 00:07:38,060
Are we now?

105
00:07:38,570 --> 00:07:39,430
The climax in...

106
00:07:39,450 --> 00:07:40,700
We're about to reach the climax, right?

107
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:43,240
The tension's rising.

108
00:07:43,610 --> 00:07:44,490
What?

109
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,720
That's not what I mean, Kum.

110
00:07:48,850 --> 00:07:49,300
Hm?

111
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,250
Stop it.

112
00:08:00,570 --> 00:08:01,310
Well...

113
00:08:01,330 --> 00:08:03,550
Thank you very much, everyone,
for making it here today.

114
00:08:03,570 --> 00:08:06,060
I'm really excited

115
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:08,080
that we'll get to watch the ending together.

116
00:08:08,220 --> 00:08:12,390
How do you feel about the series
still going so strong right now,

117
00:08:12,410 --> 00:08:14,730
while also trending at number one

118
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:16,360
in both Thailand and neighboring countries?

119
00:08:16,730 --> 00:08:18,200
I'm so delighted.

120
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:19,080
And...

121
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:20,770
Thank you for all the support

122
00:08:20,790 --> 00:08:23,060
you've given us both.

123
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,850
Is it true that you and Anda

124
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:29,120
are about to release merchandise
for fans to collect?

125
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:32,740
Can you give us a little sneak peek

126
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:34,179
at what it will look like?

127
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:38,010
I believe our fans will love it.

128
00:08:38,289 --> 00:08:39,610
Here's a hint:

129
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:41,460
you can combine two parts into one.

130
00:08:44,430 --> 00:08:45,660
Oh, how sweet!

131
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:47,800
Oh, one more thing.

132
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:51,330
There are only 100 of these, everyone.

133
00:08:51,350 --> 00:08:54,110
If you want to get your hands on one,
tonight at 7 P.M.,

134
00:08:54,130 --> 00:08:56,240
click the link on the series'
social media pages.

135
00:08:56,430 --> 00:08:57,660
After three series together,

136
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,450
when will you two finally make it official?

137
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,150
When should we announce it?

138
00:09:12,540 --> 00:09:13,460
What is this?

139
00:09:34,580 --> 00:09:35,240
Oh...

140
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:37,400
Anda?

141
00:09:42,610 --> 00:09:44,520
You don't need to go full incognito like this.

142
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,990
I want to stay by your side.

143
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,010
I miss you, Kum.

144
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,620
Don't give me that smile.

145
00:09:55,530 --> 00:09:57,440
Make sure to get some rest, okay?

146
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:59,110
I've got you right here,

147
00:09:59,850 --> 00:10:00,980
my good source of rest.

148
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:02,440
Come and let me recharge.

149
00:10:03,690 --> 00:10:04,740
What are you doing?

150
00:10:07,590 --> 00:10:08,980
Nobody will see us.

151
00:10:09,450 --> 00:10:11,020
I hopped on Chai's van

152
00:10:11,170 --> 00:10:13,010
and had him drive around
the parking lot so many times.

153
00:10:13,490 --> 00:10:14,610
Then, I got changed and came here.

154
00:10:14,980 --> 00:10:16,030
Rest assured.

155
00:10:17,730 --> 00:10:18,980
Seems like a total hassle, doesn't it?

156
00:10:20,090 --> 00:10:20,830
Mm...

157
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,570
It does...

158
00:10:22,950 --> 00:10:24,000
That's why I deserve a reward.

159
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:27,000
What are you doing?

160
00:10:27,580 --> 00:10:28,510
Come on.

161
00:10:28,690 --> 00:10:30,010
The windows are tinted.
No one can see us.

162
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:40,600
Kum.

163
00:10:42,490 --> 00:10:43,920
I want to go public.

164
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,200
Is that a good idea, Anda?

165
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:49,160
This might affect your career.

166
00:10:49,830 --> 00:10:52,250
I'm just done dating you in secret.

167
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:55,710
I won't have to go full incognito
like what I've been doing either.

168
00:10:56,860 --> 00:10:58,540
You're gaining popularity, Anda.

169
00:10:59,130 --> 00:11:00,770
You're rising to fame.

170
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:02,870
I think

171
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:05,410
we don't have to go public.

172
00:11:06,250 --> 00:11:07,520
I'm fine as it is.

173
00:11:08,740 --> 00:11:10,260
But isn't it uncomfortable?

174
00:11:11,230 --> 00:11:13,040
Not being able to be ourselves?

175
00:11:14,730 --> 00:11:17,420
Your family isn't okay with this, are they?

176
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:19,380
Your father hasn't been in touch with you

177
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:22,380
since you started working on a series,

178
00:11:25,770 --> 00:11:26,560
Hey...

179
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:27,700
Anda.

180
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:30,160
I'll leave this to you.

181
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,080
I myself

182
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:33,750
can handle it just fine.

183
00:11:35,210 --> 00:11:36,750
You can take your time.

184
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:38,920
For me,

185
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,960
simply being with you

186
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:42,610
is already enough to make me happy.

187
00:11:44,530 --> 00:11:45,430
See?

188
00:11:46,460 --> 00:11:47,740
You're always like this.

189
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:49,840
How can I not love this old dog?

190
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,860
Kiss me.

191
00:11:59,110 --> 00:12:00,350
Let's hit the road now.

192
00:12:08,450 --> 00:12:09,310
Podduang.

193
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:11,400
You sure your internet connection is fast enough?

194
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:12,920
It's slowing down because of Dunk.

195
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:14,980
He's glued to his soccer game.

196
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Dunk, turn it off already.

197
00:12:16,660 --> 00:12:17,770
Hey, what the hell?

198
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,080
The match is just as important.

199
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,180
Right now,

200
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:22,360
there's nothing as important
as the 100 figurines.

201
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:23,430
You're so right.

202
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,080
30 seconds left.

203
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,590
If I reset the router right now,

204
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,000
would you be mad at me?

205
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:31,270
- Shut up!
- Shut it!

206
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:34,680
Why not make more if you knew it'd sell?

207
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:36,000
Ten...

208
00:12:36,470 --> 00:12:37,440
Nine...

209
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,000
Eight...

210
00:12:39,470 --> 00:12:39,980
Seven...

211
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,940
[Surfer boy]

212
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,850
Six...

213
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:43,080
- Five...
- Five...

214
00:12:43,580 --> 00:12:44,400
- Four...
- Four...

215
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:45,400
- Three.
- Three.

216
00:12:45,690 --> 00:12:46,640
Two...
[Buy It Now]

217
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,680
One...

218
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,720
[Sorry, the website is temporarily unavailable]

219
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,180
Damn it...

220
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:53,240
It always happens to me.

221
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,150
What?

222
00:12:54,350 --> 00:12:55,100
What's happening?

223
00:12:55,370 --> 00:12:56,440
What the fuck happened?

224
00:12:56,460 --> 00:12:57,380
Why are you all quiet?

225
00:12:57,570 --> 00:12:58,090
I'm nervous, okay?

226
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,000
[SOLD OUT]

227
00:12:59,110 --> 00:13:00,320
Ah!

228
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:01,490
It's fucking over,

229
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:03,080
my limited edition collection!

230
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,720
I'm so upset, Bumm.

231
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:07,140
No...

232
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,570
Don't touch me!

233
00:13:08,590 --> 00:13:09,320
Oh...

234
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:12,120
She's pissed.

235
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:13,360
Better leave her be.

236
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:18,650
Who the hell is that?

237
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:22,620
I'm so sad...

238
00:13:30,350 --> 00:13:31,300
Who is it?

239
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,670
What's wrong?

240
00:13:32,690 --> 00:13:34,040
You're acting like it's Jinna.

241
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:44,230
Did you forget about your order?

242
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:45,720
You didn't answer my calls.

243
00:13:47,330 --> 00:13:48,320
Sorry.

244
00:13:49,650 --> 00:13:50,560
Jinna!

245
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:52,760
You're such a hard worker,

246
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:54,410
delivering food even on your day off.

247
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,720
How many jobs do you have?

248
00:13:56,330 --> 00:13:57,960
He reminds me of Chief Hong from
'Hometown Cha-Cha-Cha.'

249
00:13:58,330 --> 00:13:59,970
I never knew people like this existed.

250
00:13:59,990 --> 00:14:01,000
Come and hang out with us.

251
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,590
I have other work to do.

252
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,160
See you at the soccer club.

253
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,680
Dunk,

254
00:14:24,130 --> 00:14:25,240
why are you inviting him in?

255
00:14:25,420 --> 00:14:26,360
This is my place!

256
00:14:26,710 --> 00:14:27,990
Sorry, I...

257
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,440
I was being too friendly...

258
00:14:31,590 --> 00:14:32,630
Hey, come on now.

259
00:14:32,950 --> 00:14:33,840
Let's have dinner.

260
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:36,340
Yours first.

261
00:14:37,390 --> 00:14:38,230
What is it?

262
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:39,840
I don't know.

263
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,680
[Anda Confirms His Relationship
with Non-Celebrity Partner!]

264
00:15:04,510 --> 00:15:05,440
Hello, Podduang?

265
00:15:05,710 --> 00:15:06,570
Hello, Bumm.

266
00:15:06,590 --> 00:15:07,580
Have you seen the news?

267
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,650
I have. I've been waiting for you.

268
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:14,160
What made you decide to make such a bold move?

269
00:15:14,310 --> 00:15:16,720
I believe the series I've worked on

270
00:15:16,950 --> 00:15:19,430
taught me that "love has no bounds."

271
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:22,170
And I...

272
00:15:22,190 --> 00:15:25,670
I want everyone to know that
I stand by the message

273
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:28,760
that this is who I really am.

274
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:33,560
I wanted to come on this show first

275
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,800
to remind everyone that

276
00:15:36,090 --> 00:15:38,280
we all deserve to love and be loved

277
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:39,560
in our own way.

278
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:41,840
Are you worried your popularity might fade

279
00:15:42,530 --> 00:15:44,320
after going public?

280
00:15:44,610 --> 00:15:47,640
This has been something
I've thought about for a long time.

281
00:15:49,330 --> 00:15:50,090
But I've thought it through.

282
00:15:50,110 --> 00:15:53,480
I think it's worth it.

283
00:15:53,660 --> 00:15:56,600
I also believe the fans of the series
and the Andaman fandom

284
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:57,880
will understand.

285
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:01,500
Have you consulted anyone
before making the announcement?

286
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:04,280
I consulted my partner.

287
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:06,800
Is your partner a celebrity
or a non-celebrity?

288
00:16:07,410 --> 00:16:08,520
Non-celebrity.

289
00:16:09,210 --> 00:16:10,320
A pilot.

290
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:11,520
A pilot?

291
00:16:13,170 --> 00:16:14,450
What did your family say about this?

292
00:16:19,230 --> 00:16:20,920
I hope they'll understand me.

293
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:22,990
[#AndaIsNotManly]

294
00:16:23,010 --> 00:16:23,390
[The sausage-fest will rule the world.
#AndaIsNotManly]

295
00:16:23,410 --> 00:16:23,660
[This is rude.

296
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:23,900
It takes a lot for someone to come out.
Why the bullying in this day and age?]

297
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:25,280
[Mess with my baby and
you mess with me, walking red flags]

298
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:25,690
[Anda's being a twink new to you?
Heard he got ass-fucked by a soccer player]

299
00:16:25,710 --> 00:16:26,130
[Your words reflect your upbringing]

300
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:27,650
[#AndaIsNotManly Never cared about this partner.
Is the trend because of James?]

301
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:28,000
[Anda did nothing wrong.
People want to stir the pot now that he's famous]

302
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:28,510
[I'm rooting for you, Anda.
I actually don't want to use #AndaIsNotManly at all.

303
00:16:28,530 --> 00:16:29,040
#AndaAndHisSmile]

304
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:29,960
[Love you, Anda. We're so proud of you
for being yourself #AndaAndHisSmile]

305
00:16:30,490 --> 00:16:31,670
This isn't good.

306
00:16:32,310 --> 00:16:33,840
So many people reposted my tweets.

307
00:16:33,950 --> 00:16:35,240
All I see are homophobes.

308
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:38,840
A lot of the fans
are showing him support, though.

309
00:16:40,170 --> 00:16:41,500
There's nothing we can do.

310
00:16:42,150 --> 00:16:43,800
We don't even know how Anda is holding up.

311
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:45,000
Yeah.

312
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:50,540
So...

313
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:53,260
How are you and Dunk doing?

314
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:55,720
Well...

315
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,840
It's going alright.

316
00:16:59,190 --> 00:17:00,420
We've gotten used to each other.

317
00:17:01,510 --> 00:17:03,220
It feels like we're more like
friends than anything.

318
00:17:04,140 --> 00:17:05,520
It's hard to explain.

319
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:07,490
Mm.

320
00:17:08,630 --> 00:17:09,290
Podduang.

321
00:17:09,700 --> 00:17:10,700
Honestly,

322
00:17:11,150 --> 00:17:12,819
I'm a little uncomfortable

323
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,079
about dating Dunk.

324
00:17:15,069 --> 00:17:15,990
I'm...

325
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:17,150
I'm so afraid.

326
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:19,460
From our first year until now,

327
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:21,720
we know what we're like.

328
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:23,839
You know what I'm like.

329
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:26,839
My love life always comes crashing down.

330
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:30,540
I think this one's on me, really.

331
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:34,480
It probably won't be the case with Dunk.

332
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:36,310
Don't know.

333
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:37,490
Don't want to think about it.

334
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:40,680
You've been his crush since freshman year.

335
00:17:41,570 --> 00:17:42,500
And what about you?

336
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,650
When did he become your crush?

337
00:17:52,410 --> 00:17:53,720
I care about you, Podduang.

338
00:17:54,570 --> 00:17:56,010
I care so much about our group.

339
00:17:58,630 --> 00:18:00,010
Me too.

340
00:18:01,250 --> 00:18:02,590
But as for your relationship,

341
00:18:03,230 --> 00:18:04,720
I'm actually okay with it.

342
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,290
Don't worry, Bumm.

343
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:38,920
Your phone's out of juice.

344
00:18:39,330 --> 00:18:40,600
Now, you can look up the chords.

345
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:41,690
Hey, it's okay.

346
00:18:41,710 --> 00:18:42,520
I'm leaving soon.

347
00:18:42,670 --> 00:18:43,680
Come on, just take it.

348
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,660
If you rent a portable charger here,

349
00:18:45,840 --> 00:18:48,040
you can return it at any station.

350
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:54,200
Okay.

351
00:18:55,020 --> 00:18:55,610
Oh?

352
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:56,920
What's wrong, Podduang?

353
00:18:59,230 --> 00:19:00,840
You don't look okay, Podduang.

354
00:19:04,490 --> 00:19:06,040
It...It's not about that, Bumm.

355
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:08,250
What?

356
00:19:08,550 --> 00:19:09,760
Why am I out of the loop?

357
00:19:10,250 --> 00:19:11,560
It's within the Andaman fandom.

358
00:19:17,140 --> 00:19:19,190
It's about my internship hours
with the core team.

359
00:19:19,430 --> 00:19:20,960
I still don't know which team I should join.

360
00:19:21,210 --> 00:19:22,650
I told you to join the soccer team with me.

361
00:19:22,670 --> 00:19:23,480
Why complicate things?

362
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:24,900
No way!

363
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:26,650
I hate Jinna.

364
00:19:27,430 --> 00:19:28,480
I'll join the basketball team.

365
00:19:28,990 --> 00:19:29,550
It's already full.

366
00:19:29,570 --> 00:19:30,310
Where have you been?

367
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:31,120
And the volleyball team?

368
00:19:31,190 --> 00:19:32,000
Also full!

369
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:33,160
The rugby team doesn't sound so bad.

370
00:19:33,290 --> 00:19:33,610
Full!

371
00:19:33,630 --> 00:19:34,550
The swimming team?

372
00:19:34,570 --> 00:19:35,080
Also...

373
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:35,710
Full!

374
00:19:35,730 --> 00:19:36,570
What now?

375
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,120
Do I have to be with the chess team?

376
00:19:39,590 --> 00:19:40,400
That team's not full,

377
00:19:41,590 --> 00:19:42,960
but it's not on the list.

378
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:48,840
Though I think...

379
00:19:49,110 --> 00:19:50,530
the soccer team isn't a bad idea.

380
00:19:51,110 --> 00:19:52,840
Jinna isn't that bad of a guy.

381
00:19:53,260 --> 00:19:54,290
Dunk is on the team, too.

382
00:19:54,470 --> 00:19:55,580
I always come to watch him play.

383
00:19:55,840 --> 00:19:56,760
You won't be lonely.

384
00:19:59,350 --> 00:20:00,490
Do you guys notice something?

385
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:02,240
Whenever we have a problem,

386
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:04,310
we always sit on this damn bench.

387
00:20:04,650 --> 00:20:06,120
Should I just break it?

388
00:20:06,340 --> 00:20:07,430
Nonsense.

389
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,040
[DOT: DREAMS OF TOMORROW]

390
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:21,840
You almost bumped into me
and ran off again.

391
00:20:22,030 --> 00:20:22,920
Is Coach Kong here?

392
00:20:23,990 --> 00:20:25,120
You came.

393
00:20:26,070 --> 00:20:27,000
At this rate...

394
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:29,540
who's actually following who, I wonder?

395
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:30,820
I joined the club

396
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:32,020
because my friend is on the team.

397
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:33,650
I didn't want to see you.

398
00:20:34,510 --> 00:20:35,540
On top of that,

399
00:20:35,690 --> 00:20:37,720
it's almost time to submit the document.

400
00:20:38,540 --> 00:20:40,240
I don't want to intern next semester.

401
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:47,840
I already knew that.

402
00:20:48,330 --> 00:20:50,220
You explained like something was up.

403
00:20:56,620 --> 00:20:58,240
Why getting on my nerves so much?

404
00:20:58,660 --> 00:20:59,920
I'm getting on your nerves?

405
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:01,710
You're the only one

406
00:21:01,730 --> 00:21:02,840
who doesn't like me.

407
00:21:03,650 --> 00:21:04,610
Be honest.

408
00:21:05,470 --> 00:21:06,480
Are you mad at me or what?

409
00:21:11,410 --> 00:21:13,040
Or am I making you blush?!

410
00:21:14,970 --> 00:21:16,180
Alright, everyone.

411
00:21:16,630 --> 00:21:19,100
This is an intern from
the Faculty of Sports and Health Science,

412
00:21:19,290 --> 00:21:21,310
who will assist you this semester.

413
00:21:21,610 --> 00:21:23,280
Give him a round of applause
to welcome him.

414
00:21:28,840 --> 00:21:29,840
Take care of him, everyone.

415
00:21:38,860 --> 00:21:40,850
♫I once sought an answer♫

416
00:21:40,870 --> 00:21:44,010
♫To what we were together♫

417
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:47,720
♫Love, as I used to see it,♫

418
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:50,700
♫Couldn't flourish without clarity♫

419
00:21:51,980 --> 00:21:53,900
♫It took a long time♫

420
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,560
Hey, pick up the pace. Keep it up.

421
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,790
Keep the triangle going.

422
00:21:56,810 --> 00:21:58,160
There, there. That's up, back,

423
00:21:58,180 --> 00:21:59,020
and then through.

424
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:00,690
♫There are no rules♫

425
00:22:00,710 --> 00:22:03,980
♫To love that we wish to bloom♫

426
00:22:05,430 --> 00:22:07,020
♫Simply recognizing♫

427
00:22:07,050 --> 00:22:09,050
♫What your heart is desiring♫

428
00:22:09,520 --> 00:22:11,680
♫Is enough♫

429
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:43,400
Podduang.

430
00:22:46,220 --> 00:22:47,180
What is it, Bumm?

431
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:49,810
You seem pretty quiet.

432
00:22:51,560 --> 00:22:53,560
I'm sorry if I'm misunderstanding you,

433
00:22:54,380 --> 00:22:56,240
but I think you're lying to me.

434
00:22:58,700 --> 00:23:00,180
I'm fine, really.

435
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:02,680
I feel like...

436
00:23:02,700 --> 00:23:04,810
I'm hurting your feelings.

437
00:23:06,430 --> 00:23:08,600
I'm willing to go back
to just being friends with Dunk, Podduang.

438
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:11,190
If there's something you're not okay with,

439
00:23:11,210 --> 00:23:13,170
you can just tell me.

440
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,150
I'm serious.

441
00:23:16,130 --> 00:23:17,190
Bumm,

442
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,440
calm down and...

443
00:23:19,820 --> 00:23:21,290
listen to me.

444
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:25,280
I just...

445
00:23:26,190 --> 00:23:27,400
used to have a crush on Dunk.

446
00:23:28,630 --> 00:23:30,250
But I'm okay now.

447
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,510
Do you understand where I'm coming from?

448
00:23:34,090 --> 00:23:34,880
I...

449
00:23:35,250 --> 00:23:37,740
I've been disappointed
by this kind of thing so many times.

450
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,210
And I don't want to disappoint

451
00:23:39,230 --> 00:23:41,520
or have problems with my two best friends.

452
00:23:44,410 --> 00:23:46,820
I've got someone I like now.

453
00:23:48,330 --> 00:23:48,970
Huh?

454
00:23:49,950 --> 00:23:50,760
I'm sorry?

455
00:23:53,670 --> 00:23:54,450
Well...

456
00:23:55,410 --> 00:23:56,820
We've started seeing each other.

457
00:23:57,670 --> 00:23:58,570
Who is it?

458
00:24:01,330 --> 00:24:02,280
It's Jinna.

459
00:24:02,690 --> 00:24:03,350
Huh?

460
00:24:03,820 --> 00:24:04,560
Jinna?

461
00:24:06,170 --> 00:24:07,120
You mean that Jinna?

462
00:24:07,410 --> 00:24:08,360
Which Jinna?

463
00:24:09,470 --> 00:24:10,780
It's that Jinna, alright?

464
00:24:12,820 --> 00:24:13,690
The Jinna.

465
00:24:36,630 --> 00:24:37,950
Damn it...

466
00:24:37,970 --> 00:24:39,600
What did I just tell her?

467
00:24:49,970 --> 00:24:51,990
Please, calm down, honey.

468
00:25:15,820 --> 00:25:16,820
Anda.

469
00:25:17,190 --> 00:25:18,800
Why did you come home so early?

470
00:25:19,250 --> 00:25:20,880
I want to see you, Mom.

471
00:25:21,230 --> 00:25:21,690
Gosh.

472
00:25:21,710 --> 00:25:24,040
You know what your dad is like lately.

473
00:25:30,330 --> 00:25:31,520
And what about you?

474
00:25:32,970 --> 00:25:34,190
Are you okay

475
00:25:34,820 --> 00:25:35,650
with...

476
00:25:35,990 --> 00:25:37,760
what I said in the announcement?

477
00:25:39,330 --> 00:25:41,430
You already know how I feel.

478
00:25:42,690 --> 00:25:44,880
I still love you like I always have,

479
00:25:45,820 --> 00:25:48,530
but you need to find some time
to talk to your dad.

480
00:25:50,110 --> 00:25:51,330
But I think...

481
00:25:51,820 --> 00:25:54,550
it's best to wait until he's a bit calmer.

482
00:25:55,250 --> 00:25:56,900
Am I so wrong

483
00:25:58,090 --> 00:25:59,120
that this is who I am?

484
00:26:13,820 --> 00:26:14,610
And...

485
00:26:14,990 --> 00:26:16,510
Does your brother know about this?

486
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,480
He doesn't.

487
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,400
I hope...

488
00:26:20,570 --> 00:26:22,240
Itti will understand me.

489
00:27:28,520 --> 00:27:29,760
Everyone's left.

490
00:27:30,190 --> 00:27:30,960
Need something?

491
00:27:32,040 --> 00:27:32,800
Uh...

492
00:27:32,820 --> 00:27:34,490
Jinna, I...

493
00:27:34,520 --> 00:27:35,440
You like me?

494
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:37,120
Not that.

495
00:27:37,990 --> 00:27:39,160
I don't like you,

496
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:42,160
and there's no way I would.

497
00:27:43,110 --> 00:27:44,240
Why did you say that, then?

498
00:27:45,270 --> 00:27:46,780
I just...

499
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:50,230
I just want to
make my best friend feel better.

500
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:52,620
By lying that you're seeing me?

501
00:27:53,370 --> 00:27:54,190
For what?

502
00:27:54,450 --> 00:27:56,040
Fine. I'm sorry, then.

503
00:27:56,490 --> 00:27:58,160
I didn't mean to tell her that.

504
00:27:59,050 --> 00:27:59,940
I just...

505
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:02,110
didn't want to hurt my friend's feelings.

506
00:28:03,650 --> 00:28:04,600
That means...

507
00:28:06,010 --> 00:28:07,820
You and Bumm like the same person?

508
00:28:11,560 --> 00:28:12,350
Dunk, is it?

509
00:28:16,970 --> 00:28:18,800
Since I already used
your name as an excuse,

510
00:28:18,820 --> 00:28:19,990
can you hit on me?

511
00:28:28,820 --> 00:28:29,820
What did you just say?

512
00:28:31,570 --> 00:28:33,000
I know you heard me.

513
00:28:34,820 --> 00:28:37,370
Can you pretend you're hitting on me?

514
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:40,410
And...

515
00:28:41,710 --> 00:28:43,200
Why would I do that?

516
00:28:45,280 --> 00:28:47,820
You asked me what I was mad at you about.

517
00:28:48,820 --> 00:28:49,600
And?

518
00:28:50,570 --> 00:28:52,720
If you pretend to hit on me, I'll...

519
00:28:52,930 --> 00:28:54,520
I'll let it go and stop being mad at you.

520
00:28:57,820 --> 00:28:58,660
Please?

521
00:28:58,680 --> 00:28:59,670
Just for a month.

522
00:29:00,360 --> 00:29:01,590
I'm only asking for a month.

523
00:29:03,130 --> 00:29:04,160
A month?

524
00:29:07,090 --> 00:29:07,820
Okay.

525
00:29:09,080 --> 00:29:10,820
And that means...?

526
00:29:14,150 --> 00:29:14,640
I'll

527
00:29:14,660 --> 00:29:15,200
hit

528
00:29:15,220 --> 00:29:15,740
on

529
00:29:15,760 --> 00:29:16,480
you.

530
00:29:35,820 --> 00:29:37,100
Do you two realize

531
00:29:37,820 --> 00:29:39,360
you've been acting really strange?

532
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:41,170
Seriously,

533
00:29:41,610 --> 00:29:43,280
when did you and Jinna start talking?

534
00:29:44,950 --> 00:29:45,560
Well...

535
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,210
Why?

536
00:29:48,410 --> 00:29:49,370
Worried about your friend?

537
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:52,150
I don't get it.

538
00:29:52,820 --> 00:29:53,590
I'm confused.

539
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:56,110
Tell me I'm not dreaming.

540
00:29:56,960 --> 00:29:57,540
Ow...

541
00:29:57,560 --> 00:29:59,060
What dreaming?

542
00:29:59,080 --> 00:29:59,960
Fine!

543
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,160
I believe now.

544
00:30:01,310 --> 00:30:03,430
You shook my head so hard
my brain's all upside down.

545
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:04,920
Well, just in case you're still dreaming.

546
00:30:05,710 --> 00:30:07,760
From now on, I hope you don't mind

547
00:30:07,950 --> 00:30:09,040
if I hit on your buddy, okay?

548
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:11,080
Sure.

549
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:12,840
No problem.

550
00:30:14,230 --> 00:30:15,080
He's yours.

551
00:30:21,040 --> 00:30:21,800
Dig in.

552
00:30:24,820 --> 00:30:25,540
So bland.

553
00:30:25,560 --> 00:30:26,860
Yeah, so is my drink.

554
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:27,800
What? Are you kidding me?

555
00:30:27,820 --> 00:30:28,760
Let me have a sip.

556
00:30:28,820 --> 00:30:29,260
Hey...

557
00:30:29,280 --> 00:30:31,260
You want my drink, don't you?

558
00:30:31,280 --> 00:30:32,020
Not a chance.

559
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:34,480
I want to drink some Thai tea, too. Let's share.

560
00:30:35,170 --> 00:30:35,880
Podduang!

561
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:41,880
I got you a bag of cocoa.

562
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,510
My heart's about to stop.

563
00:31:01,530 --> 00:31:02,270
It's okay.

564
00:31:02,290 --> 00:31:03,610
I'll call for a rescue team.

565
00:31:05,900 --> 00:31:07,220
[Following]

566
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,640
